    "goal": "Co-incubate CYP3A4 with 4-methylumbelliferone at 1609.4 µM in the presence of a competitive inhibitor (Ki = 174.1 µM) at 24.7 µM and report the inhibited reaction velocity, fractional activity remaining, and apparent Km.",
    "rationale": "Competitive inhibition kinetics for CYP3A4 with 4-methylumbelliferone as substrate. Km = 1488.9 µM, [S] = 1609.4 µM, Ki = 174.1 µM, [I] = 24.7 µM, Vmax = 2.438 µmol/min. Under competitive inhibition, Vmax is unchanged and only the apparent Km rises (Km^app = Km(1+[I]/Ki)). Fractional activity = [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]); inhibited velocity = Vmax·[S]/(Km^app+[S]).",
